{"sections":[],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"class","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeBusinessToolsTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange Business Tools"}],"title":"OrangeBusinessToolsTheme","externalID":"s:29OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools0bcD5ThemeC","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeBusinessToolsTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"roleHeading":"Class"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools"]]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The `Orange Business Tools`` theme is an Orange theme but tailored for some products with heavy UI."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"final","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeBusinessToolsTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Usages","level":2,"anchor":"Usages"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Some products may have heavy and very rich user interfaces with a lot of components and elements to displays and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with which users can interact. Thus for such products there are specific constraints of spaces and sizes, even if"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"these products must be Orange flavored."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"That is the reason why this team is created: a kind of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" but wih adjustments on some tokens like spacings and sizings."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To get the theme:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    @Environment(\\.theme) var theme"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Integration","level":2,"anchor":"Integration"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To use this theme, inject it to your view using "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSThemeableView"},{"type":"text","text":" and get it through environment variable."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    @main","    struct YourApp: App {","        var body: some Scene {","            WindowGroup {","                OUDSThemeableView(theme: OrangeBusinessToolsTheme()) {","                    \/\/ Your root view","                }","            }","        }","    }"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Theme tuning","level":2,"anchor":"Theme-tuning"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The theme can be customized a bit for more flexibility thanks to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Tuning"},{"type":"text","text":" object."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"You just need to give a predefined tuning configuration at theme init to build the one you need."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To apply the tuning:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ Define your theme tuning","    let tuning = Tuning(hasRoundedButtons: true, hasRoundedTextInputs: true)","","    \/\/ Apply it to your theme","    let theme = OrangeBusinessToolsTheme(tuning: tuning)","    \/\/ Or in one line","    let theme = OrangeBusinessToolsTheme(tuning: Tuning(hasRoundedButtons: true, hasRoundedTextInputs: true))","","    \/\/ Or apply predefined tunings","    let orangeFranceTheme = OrangeBusinessToolsTheme(tuning: Tuning.OrangeFrance)","    let orangeBusinessTheme = OrangeBusinessToolsTheme(tuning: Tuning.OrangeBusiness)","    let maxitTheme = OrangeBusinessToolsTheme(tuning: Tuning.MaxIt)"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Typography","level":2,"anchor":"Typography"},{"type":"heading","text":"Helvetica Neue","level":3,"anchor":"Helvetica-Neue"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange brand strongly relies on the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" font family. Thus each Orange brand should, or must, use it."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"For iOS the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" font family is available at system level, so it is not needed to get it through external assets."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"By default an instance of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeBusinessToolsTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" uses as font family the token "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OrangeBrandFontRawTokens.familyBrandDefault"},{"type":"text","text":", which is today "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"If you want to use another font family, you will have to send the suitable token or the suitable font family."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"However, beware, iOS API relies also on the PostScript name of the font."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"To be sure of the value to use, look at the font book of your device."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It is recommended to use the font raw tokens."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    \/\/ The following instanciations work","    let orangeTheme = OrangeBusinessToolsTheme()","    let orangeTheme = OrangeBusinessToolsTheme(fontFamily: OrangeBrandFontRawTokens.familyBrandDefault)","    let orangeTheme = OrangeBusinessToolsTheme(fontFamily: \"HelveticaNeue\") \/\/ Which is PostScript name of the font","    let orangeTheme = OrangeBusinessToolsTheme(fontFamily: \"Helvetica Neue\")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Helvetica Neue Arabic","level":3,"anchor":"Helvetica-Neue-Arabic"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Because the "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" font family does not manage arabic alphabet but latin one, it is possible apply another font family to the theme like the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"text":"Helvetica Neue Arabic","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":". This font family assets can be retrieved through the "},{"identifier":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PostScript name management has been implemented for this font family, thus the weight are managed and it is only needed to add the font assets to the project,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"register them and define the font family name to use."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["    let orangeTheme = OrangeBusinessToolsTheme(fontFamily: \"Helvetica Neue Arabic\")"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"heading","text":"Tokens versions","level":2,"anchor":"Tokens-versions"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Core OUDS version: 1.9.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Core Orange version: 1.2.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Brand Orange Business Tools version: 2.3.0","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"aside","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"0.17.0","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Since","style":"note"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"topicSections":[{"anchor":"Initializers","title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/OrangeBusinessToolsTheme\/init(fontFamily:tuning:)"],"generated":true}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangebusinesstools\/orangebusinesstoolstheme"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/OrangeBusinessToolsTheme","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"kind":"relationships","title":"Inherits From","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme"],"type":"inheritsFrom"},{"kind":"relationships","title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/SQ","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools/SQ":{"title":"Swift.Equatable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/SQ"},"doc://OUDSThemesContract/documentation/OUDSThemesContract/OUDSTheme":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"This is a basic theme any theme must be a subclass off, or all themes must have as ancestor."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A Swift "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"class"},{"type":"text","text":" has been used so as to allow to easily override some attributes and have inheritance, without having for developers"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to implement all tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Any properties of an overridable theme should be defined so as to provide defaults values."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"We allow this theme to be derivated and be overriden."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" can be seen as a kind of “abstract class” in "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"object oriented paradigm"}]},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"theme contract"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Because "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" is not a "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"final"}]},{"type":"text","text":" class, its type cannot be seen as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Sendable"},{"type":"text","text":", that is the reason why this conformity is unchecked."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"OUDSTheme"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemescontract\/oudstheme","type":"topic","title":"OUDSTheme","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/OUDSTheme","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools/documentation/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools":{"images":[{"identifier":"ic_theme_orangebusinesstools.png","type":"icon"}],"role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange Business Tools theme is dedicated to applications with strong dimensions constraints."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangebusinesstools","type":"topic","title":"Theme Orange Business Tools","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools/documentation/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools/OrangeBusinessToolsTheme/init(fontFamily:tuning:)":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Constructor of the OrangeBusinessTools theme with its own providers of tokens.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"It uses also the providers of charts colors from Orange theme (","type":"text"},{"code":"OrangeThemeColorChartSemanticTokensProvider","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":").","type":"text"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"fontFamily"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic010FontFamilyB5Tokena","text":"FontFamilySemanticToken"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tuning"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract6Tuninga","text":"Tuning"},{"kind":"text","text":")"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangebusinesstools\/orangebusinesstoolstheme\/init(fontfamily:tuning:)","type":"topic","title":"init(fontFamily:tuning:)","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/OrangeBusinessToolsTheme\/init(fontFamily:tuning:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools/documentation/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools/OrangeBusinessToolsTheme":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeBusinessToolsTheme","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/OrangeBusinessToolsTheme","kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"OrangeBusinessToolsTheme","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The `Orange Business Tools`` theme is an Orange theme but tailored for some products with heavy UI."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorangebusinesstools\/orangebusinesstoolstheme","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeBusinessToolsTheme","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools/s8SendableP":{"title":"Swift.Sendable","type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/s8SendableP"},"https://brand.orange.com/en/brand-basics/typography":{"url":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography","title":"Orange Brand website (authentication needed)","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Orange Brand website (authentication needed)"}],"type":"link","identifier":"https:\/\/brand.orange.com\/en\/brand-basics\/typography"},"ic_theme_orangebusinesstools.png":{"alt":null,"variants":[{"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrangeBusinessTools\/ic_theme_orangebusinesstools.png","traits":["1x","light"]}],"type":"image","identifier":"ic_theme_orangebusin